{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Finally, arrive floats high in the cove. She realizes she never really got to understand how she could help this cause and it only lead to her death in an attempt. She sits down on a box nearby and supports her head with her arm. Crossing her legs and pondering. She would turn a little blue, but the ghost form prevents her from showing her emotions. She's half thankful, feeling as if she can be like everyone else she's been around...","created_at":"2021-08-05T17:02:15.576000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-05T17:02:47.124000Z","id":"872887240416694303","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"The wooden gunsmith sets up shop here. Available to purchase are fae'd wood versions of all mundane firearms. Any firearms with special properties (volt thrower, misty shot, etc.) must be individually commissioned and will be notably more costly and take time.\nMundane firearms have their cost increased by 25 for being made of the wood and this having the crit property. These weapons do not use traditional ammunition, instead using essence in their place. A common essence provides 8 shots, an uncommon 20, a rare 45, a very rare 100, and a legendary 250. Ammunition can also be bought here, for the price of 20 gold per 5 shots. This ammunition is derived from essence, but cannot be used for crafting or conversion and cannot be sold. The gunsmith is often working here and may have new products in the future...\n\n(Please state if you buy anything from them and if I'm online ping me if you want to rp with them)","created_at":"2021-08-15T03:28:44.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876306390157778995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
